@startuml
title CTS Activity Flow

start

:Receive instructions from trade client serve;
:Analyze incoming instructions;
:Divide instructions into kinds;
:Match instructions under specific prescripts;
if (Determine instruction type) then (buy instruction)
:Save buy instruction;
:Match buy instructions with same stock id;
if (Buy matching result) then (matched stock exists)
:Make trade by matching for buy;
:Modify matched instruction information for buy;
:Give out successful trade information;
:Save trade information;
else (no matched stock exists)
:Handle no matched stock;
endif
else (sell instruction)
:Save sell instruction;
:Match sell instructions with same stock id;
if (Sell matching result) then (matched stock exists)
:Make trade by matching for sell;
:Modify matched instruction information for sell;
else (no matched stock exists)
endif
endif
else (cancel instruction)
:Save cancel instruction;
:Cancel correlative instruction;
else (query request)
:Send query to CTS;
:Implement query;
:Structuralize queried data;
:Send data to release;

stop

@enduml